          "title": "You'll want to know: ചാറുക",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ചാറുക — cāṟuka — \"to drizzle\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പുറത്ത് മഴ ചാറുന്നു. puṟattŭ maḻa cāṟunnu. It is drizzling outside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: ചാറി, cāṟi."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The subject is the rain: മഴ ചാറുന്നു, the rain drizzles."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ചാറുക (cāṟuka) is native Dravidian, \"to run off; to drizzle\" (DEDR 2482)."
            }
          ]
        },
