          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "പേമാരി (pēmāri) is a Malayalam word for heavy rain whose second part is മാരി, heavy rain (DEDR 4819, which compares Sanskrit māri, rain); the origin of the first part is not settled."
            }
          ]
